{"id":"n71103-1-12","stage":1,"title":"우산 · 雨伞","scene":"穿着与购物","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n71103-1-12-1","ko":"비 맞고 왔니? 옷이 다 젖었구나.","zh":"你是被雨淋了吗？衣服都湿透了啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"비","meaning":"雨","explanation":"비：雨。","readings":[{"term":"비","audio":"/audio/5e0d62698b44a4342d26.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36681","senseId":"1","lemma":"비","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"비","audio":"/audio/5e0d62698b44a4342d26.mp3"}},{"text":"맞고","meaning":"淋","explanation":"맞다：淋；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"맞다","audio":"/audio/6d08580e9b08815338a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66232","senseId":"4","lemma":"맞다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"맞고","audio":"/audio/1bf1b83d82693f3ed205.mp3"}},{"text":"왔니?","meaning":"来，来到","explanation":"오다：来，来到；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"1","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왔니","audio":"/audio/fcfe3eb77392c7ddf554.mp3"}},{"text":"옷이","meaning":"衣服，衣裳，服装","explanation":"옷：衣服，衣裳，服装；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"옷","audio":"/audio/4bddf9b9203384c7b240.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30159","senseId":"1","lemma":"옷","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"옷이","audio":"/audio/4ed934dde6defcc6f810.mp3"}},{"text":"다","meaning":"全，都","explanation":"다：全，都。","readings":[{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58175","senseId":"1","lemma":"다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}},{"text":"젖었구나.","meaning":"沾湿，浸湿，润湿","explanation":"젖다：沾湿，浸湿，润湿；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；구나：对新发现或新理解的情况表示感叹，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"젖다","audio":"/audio/5f61a84f921197b6dee3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64729","senseId":"1","lemma":"젖다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"젖었구나","audio":"/audio/f593a40f346181e7cc68.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"5e0d62698b44a434","term":"비","zh":"雨","audio":"/audio/5e0d62698b44a4342d26.mp3","entryId":"36681","definition":"高空中形成云朵的水蒸气冷却凝聚后降落而下的水滴。","pronunciation":["비"]},{"id":"6d08580e9b088153","term":"맞다","zh":"淋","audio":"/audio/6d08580e9b08815338a6.mp3","entryId":"66232","definition":"不避开而迎着下的雨雪等。","pronunciation":["맏따"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"来，来到","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"从别的地方移动到这个地方。","pronunciation":["오다"]},{"id":"4bddf9b9203384c7","term":"옷","zh":"衣服，衣裳，服装","audio":"/audio/4bddf9b9203384c7b240.mp3","entryId":"30159","definition":"为遮掩身体、防晒抗寒以及追求美观而穿的遮挡物。","pronunciation":["옫"]},{"id":"822b7db6f6886f57","term":"다","zh":"全，都","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3","entryId":"58175","definition":"无剩余或遗漏，所有的。","pronunciation":["다ː"]},{"id":"5f61a84f921197b6","term":"젖다","zh":"沾湿，浸湿，润湿","audio":"/audio/5f61a84f921197b6dee3.mp3","entryId":"64729","definition":"液体渗入，变得潮湿。","pronunciation":["젇따"]}],"audio":"/audio/19c592e9aebaac880503.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n71103-1-12-2","ko":"바람이 하도 불어서 우산을 써도 소용이 없었어요.","zh":"风太大了，就算撑伞也没用。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"바람이","meaning":"风","explanation":"바람：风；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"바람","audio":"/audio/9ec024bb0ceb6fd21e9a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"85627","senseId":"1","lemma":"바람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"바람이","audio":"/audio/406cc056290e155abc22.mp3"}},{"text":"하도","meaning":"过于，太","explanation":"하도：过于，太。","readings":[{"term":"하도","audio":"/audio/a69330a0e09b93c8f165.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84302","senseId":"1","lemma":"하도","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하도","audio":"/audio/a69330a0e09b93c8f165.mp3"}},{"text":"불어서","meaning":"刮，吹","explanation":"불다：刮，吹；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"불다","audio":"/audio/1389fa35feb8849f522f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74179","senseId":"1","lemma":"불다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"불어서","audio":"/audio/2e75e14f0df0412d0885.mp3"}},{"text":"우산을","meaning":"雨伞","explanation":"우산：雨伞；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"우산","audio":"/audio/8b6f9142a49be5004b82.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71103","senseId":"1","lemma":"우산","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"우산을","audio":"/audio/21bd32506dc8d1c0fce2.mp3"}},{"text":"써도","meaning":"撑，打","explanation":"쓰다：撑，打；어도：表示让步：“即使、就算”；-아/어도 되다 表示“可以”。","readings":[{"term":"쓰다","audio":"/audio/e5721a077be2e027ff8c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65173","senseId":"4","lemma":"쓰다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"써도","audio":"/audio/2371f0d8e2bb536b8c1b.mp3"}},{"text":"소용이","meaning":"用处","explanation":"소용：用处；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"소용","audio":"/audio/11cc085051529997d458.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49244","senseId":"1","lemma":"소용","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"소용이","audio":"/audio/1211fa950ff0d71d2a1c.mp3"}},{"text":"없었어요.","meaning":"没有（소용이 없다：没有用处）","explanation":"없다：没有（소용이 없다：没有用处）；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"11","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"없었어요","audio":"/audio/2ac65f9511472d67215d.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"9ec024bb0ceb6fd2","term":"바람","zh":"风","audio":"/audio/9ec024bb0ceb6fd21e9a.mp3","entryId":"85627","definition":"气压的变化或者人类、机器等引起的空气的流动。","pronunciation":["바람"]},{"id":"a69330a0e09b93c8","term":"하도","zh":"过于，太","audio":"/audio/a69330a0e09b93c8f165.mp3","entryId":"84302","definition":"(强调)非常过分或特别大地。","pronunciation":["하도"]},{"id":"1389fa35feb8849f","term":"불다","zh":"刮，吹","audio":"/audio/1389fa35feb8849f522f.mp3","entryId":"74179","definition":"风起而向某个方向移动。","pronunciation":["불ː다"]},{"id":"8b6f9142a49be500","term":"우산","zh":"雨伞","audio":"/audio/8b6f9142a49be5004b82.mp3","entryId":"71103","definition":"在长竿上铺上像遮盖物一样的膜，下雨时用手举着遮雨的工具。","pronunciation":["우ː산"]},{"id":"e5721a077be2e027","term":"쓰다","zh":"撑，打","audio":"/audio/e5721a077be2e027ff8c.mp3","entryId":"65173","definition":"将雨伞或阳伞等展开而举在头顶上。","pronunciation":["쓰다"]},{"id":"11cc085051529997","term":"소용","zh":"用处","audio":"/audio/11cc085051529997d458.mp3","entryId":"49244","definition":"某种利益或用途。","pronunciation":["소ː용"]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다","zh":"没有（소용이 없다：没有用处）","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3","entryId":"89917","definition":"没有（소용이 없다：没有用处）","pronunciation":["업ː따"]}],"audio":"/audio/0df7641d43c540a53ff6.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.925,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=71103","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":53,"sequenceScore":2.3494,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["你是被雨淋了吗？衣服都湿透了啊。","风太大了，就算撑伞也没用。","智秀啊，你上次说的那部电影的标题叫什么来着？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["你是被雨淋了吗？衣服都湿透了啊。","风太大了，就算撑伞也没用。","智秀啊，你上次说的那部电影的标题叫什么来着？"],"answer":1}]}
